{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act21side_level_act21side_06_end",
  "groupId": "act21side",
  "stageId": "act21side_06",
  "title": "旧日碾轧",
  "storyCode": "IS-6",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act21side/level_act21side_06_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "ef8b85efb6f6f95badd3ea3b1ec82326d60a2062abe9645a5d5e0345432c3092",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗塞蒂家族成员",
      "text": "撤退，这家伙很棘手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗塞蒂家族成员",
      "text": "不要和她硬来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗塞蒂家族成员",
      "text": "守住通往首领的包厢的走道和楼梯口！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "text": "啧啧，罗塞蒂的人还挺能干嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "text": "想要强行突破看起来不太现实啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "text": "嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "text": "哈哈，德克萨斯这家伙，明明是在贝斯里装了录音器。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "text": "弹得还挺像那么一回事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "text": "啊哈，有了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "text": "正面突破不行的话......那就造一条路出来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗塞蒂家族成员",
      "text": "别慌张！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗塞蒂家族成员",
      "text": "守住这里！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝洛内家族成员",
      "text": "啧，这些家伙，不怕死吗！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗塞蒂家族成员",
      "text": "咕......啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "text": "其他人的情况如何？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝洛内家族成员",
      "text": "通往乔万娜包厢的各个走道和楼梯口都被守住了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝洛内家族成员",
      "text": "他们的准备很充分。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "text": "不愧是罗塞蒂......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "text": "不过，我们从一开始就没有小看乔万娜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "text": "继续投入人力，今天，乔万娜必须留在这里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "text": "你们或许没有小看乔万娜，但是不是有点太小看我了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝洛内家族成员",
      "text": "什——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "text": "你是......瓦拉赫。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "text": "哼，早知道今天演的是这样一出好戏，我就不费劲去给首领拿酒了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "text": "乔万娜小姐要是对酒感兴趣，我这里倒也有一些好货。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "text": "免了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "text": "首领喜欢叙拉古的许多东西，但唯独叙拉古的酒，总是喝不惯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "text": "叙拉古的酒，太软，就和你们挥动武器的力道一样，让人提不起劲。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "text": "那或许是你们还没有喝过叙拉古真正的好酒。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "text": "所以，这不就是最好的机会吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "text": "你们知道我等这个机会等很久了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "text": "贝洛内和萨卢佐，让我尝尝吧，叙拉古的好酒，到底是什么味道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗塞蒂家族成员",
      "text": "想从这里上去？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗塞蒂家族成员",
      "text": "拦住她！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "text": "谁告诉你，我要上去了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗塞蒂家族成员",
      "text": "什么，炸药？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗塞蒂家族成员",
      "text": "散开！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "text": "呜哇，那边的看台塌下来了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "那是——拉普兰德？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惊恐的观众",
      "text": "你看那边！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗塞蒂家族成员",
      "text": "咕......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惊恐的观众",
      "text": "难、难道说是家族仇杀......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "让开。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗塞蒂家族成员",
      "text": "她、她竟然把武器藏在乐器里？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "德克萨斯！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "德克萨斯没有说话，只是看了她一眼，张了张嘴，然后就向楼上冲去。\n空辨认出了她的口型。\n她说：等我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慌乱的观众",
      "text": "噫——快、快跑！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "text": "怎么办，能天使，空会有危险的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "但是——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惊恐的观众",
      "text": "救、救命——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "趴下！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "哇哦，老爷爷你好厉害啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "我看起来很老吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "嗯......倒也没到那个地步。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "看来，今天上演的，并不是《德克萨斯之死》，而是《罗塞蒂之殇》。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "孩子，去避难吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "......虽然我们也想这么做，但是，我们的朋友还在舞台上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "text": "可舞台周围已经乱成一团了，我们直接冲过去太危险了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "那就走后台！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "text": "好！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "啧，别拦路！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "text": "欸？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "去吧，勇敢的孩子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "谢谢你，老爷爷！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "之后请你吃披萨！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "text": "谢谢！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "呵呵，年轻人总是充满了活力。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "接下来，你打算怎么做呢，乔万娜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗塞蒂家族成员",
      "text": "首领，各个路口现在都在我们的掌控中，您趁现在离开这里吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔万娜",
      "text": "为什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔万娜",
      "text": "难得有个能好好观赏这场好戏的地方，我自然要尽兴才行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔万娜",
      "text": "空，你果然是她的朋友吗......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔万娜",
      "text": "要从那里上来吗，切利尼娜？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔万娜",
      "text": "不过，就算有了捷径，想要到我这里来，也不会那么轻松的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗塞蒂家族成员",
      "text": "但是——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔万娜",
      "text": "难道你认为，我现在逃跑之后，贝洛内和萨卢佐就会放过我们？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔万娜",
      "text": "这是开战，亲爱的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔万娜",
      "text": "贝洛内和萨卢佐无视了西西里夫人的禁令，选择了对另外一个家族全面开战。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔万娜",
      "text": "传话下去，我们能做的，只有——和他们对抗到底。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗塞蒂家族成员",
      "text": "是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "text": "......呃。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "text": "看来，叙拉古的好酒，也不过如此。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "text": "哥伦比亚杂碎......少得意了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "text": "什——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "text": "是，我知道，在你们叙拉古人眼里，我们这些哥伦比亚家族全都是没有积淀的暴发户。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "text": "哥伦比亚那边这样的蠢货确实有许多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "text": "但是你们呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "text": "在所谓的“铳与秩序”之下，你们的血性又剩下多少呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "text": "我从来没有小看过叙拉古。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "text": "但现在看来，至少你们这些人，没有什么值得我看重的地方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗塞蒂家族成员",
      "text": "瓦拉赫，剧院那边出状况了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗塞蒂家族成员",
      "text": "有人把看台炸了下来，切利尼娜直接去三楼了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "text": "给你五秒钟说遗言。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "text": "遗言？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "text": "呵，哪有什么遗言。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "text": "你真有这个工夫，帮我和莱昂图索说一声抱歉吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "text": "好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "text": "什——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "text": "莱昂？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "text": "你......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱昂图索",
      "text": "我会用我的方式顾全大局，德米特。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "text": "莱昂图索大少爷，我还以为，我们之间能够愉快相处。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱昂图索",
      "text": "从现在开始也不是没有机会。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "text": "瞧瞧，大家族出来的人气度就是不一样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "text": "骑到我的头上来了，还告诉我，还有机会挽回。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱昂图索",
      "text": "事已至此。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱昂图索",
      "text": "来打个赌吧，瓦拉赫。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "text": "打赌？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "text": "哈哈哈哈哈，我的莱昂大少爷，这里不是宴会场，也不是办公室。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "text": "这里是战场，我们在这里只有你死我活。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱昂图索",
      "text": "相信我，这是个你会喜欢的赌约。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝洛内家族成员",
      "text": "啧，罗塞蒂家族的人，真是难缠。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝洛内家族成员",
      "text": "法官阁下？我们没有收到你会参与这次行动的消息。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝洛内家族成员",
      "text": "而且，这不是你能够介入的事情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉维妮娅",
      "text": "......我不想妨碍你们，现在，我也没有那个兴趣了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉维妮娅",
      "text": "我在找人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝洛内家族成员",
      "text": "找人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝洛内家族成员",
      "text": "现在剧院里很乱，恐怕没有你要找的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉维妮娅",
      "text": "你们只要别来妨碍我就可以了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝洛内家族成员",
      "text": "但是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉维妮娅",
      "text": "我死在这里，也和贝洛内家族无关。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝洛内家族成员",
      "text": "......请便。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉维妮娅",
      "text": "找到了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗塞蒂家族成员",
      "text": "站住。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洗车工",
      "text": "我是这里的工作人员。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗塞蒂家族成员",
      "text": "工作人员？工作人员早就被我们赶走了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉维妮娅",
      "text": "啧，为什么他会在那里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉维妮娅",
      "text": "当心，丹——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "血液飞溅，有几滴洒到了拉维妮娅脸上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洗车工",
      "text": "拉维妮娅小姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洗车工",
      "text": "......你怎么会在这里？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "拉普兰德开辟的“道路”十分有效，还有一小段路，她就可以见到她的老朋友。\n她微微呼出一口气。\n场面一片混乱，但她知道自己想做什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "text": "你果然来了，切利尼娜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "text": "你现在的眼神很好，让我感觉我像一个猎物。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "text": "让我见识见识你有多大的能耐吧，最后的德克萨斯！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢比奥",
      "text": "这......总监阁下，这场混乱......也是演出的一环吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝纳尔多",
      "text": "混乱？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝纳尔多",
      "text": "在我看来，一切都井然有序，卢比奥部长。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝纳尔多",
      "text": "而接下来，正要渐入佳境。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢比奥",
      "text": "......我懂了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢比奥",
      "text": "您领导的不愧是沃尔西尼最负盛名的剧团之一，这样别开生面的剧目我是头一次见到。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝纳尔多",
      "text": "不过，接下来，是中场休息时间，现在，你可以说一说，你想从我这里获得什么了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢比奥",
      "text": "我想要的东西......不复杂。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢比奥",
      "text": "卡拉奇死后，建设部部长的人选一直悬而未决。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢比奥",
      "text": "想必您也一直在挑选合适的人选。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝纳尔多",
      "text": "你想说，你就是那个人选？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢比奥",
      "text": "事实上，我认为没有比我更合适的人了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "text": "咳咳，咳，呕......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "text": "这种时候还有力气手下留情......真是了不起。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "text": "不动手吗，萨卢佐家的疯子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "text": "我可不想和一个从一开始就没打算用全力的家伙进行无意义的厮杀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "text": "......呵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "text": "你在等什么，你在期待什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "text": "我和人打了一个赌，我希望我赌输了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "瓦拉赫看向德克萨斯离去的方向，没有人能阻碍德克萨斯刺杀乔万娜。\n除了乔万娜自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "房间内空无一人。\n德克萨斯立刻意识到发生了什么，然而为时已晚，一把刀架在了她的脖子上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔万娜",
      "text": "自从来到叙拉古之后，我设想过无数种被人刺杀的方式。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔万娜",
      "text": "唯独没有想过，会是你走到我的面前。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔万娜",
      "text": "而你，居然在这个时候放松了警惕。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔万娜",
      "text": "你难道以为——只要见到我，我就会抱抱你，说，“切利尼娜，太好了，你真的没死”？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔万娜",
      "text": "然后我们可以坐下喝一杯，聊一聊过去几年发生的事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "我是来杀你的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔万娜",
      "text": "很好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "这么说着，乔万娜却放下了手中的刀。\n她的脸上笑意盈盈，神情中满怀思念，像是刚才的杀意只是一个小小的玩笑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔万娜",
      "text": "好久不见，切利尼娜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "好久不见，乔万娜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
